# mbsync configuration for syncing Gmail accounts to Maildir
# Syncs to volumes/Maildir/ (symlinked to /share/hhartmann/var/mbsync/Maildir)

#
# hhartmann.1729@gmail.com
#
IMAPAccount gmail-hhartmann
Host imap.gmail.com
User hhartmann.1729@gmail.com
PassCmd "cat secrets/gmail_hhartmann.key"
Port 993
SSLType IMAPS
AuthMechs LOGIN

IMAPStore gmail-hhartmann-remote
Account gmail-hhartmann

MaildirStore gmail-hhartmann-local
Path ../volumes/Maildir/hhartmann.1729/
Inbox ../volumes/Maildir/hhartmann.1729/Inbox
SubFolders Verbatim

Channel gmail-hhartmann
Far :gmail-hhartmann-remote:
Near :gmail-hhartmann-local:
Patterns "[Gmail]/All Mail" "[Gmail]/Sent Mail"
Create Near
Expunge Near
Sync Pull
ExpireUnread yes

